---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/src/cloud/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Builds the project on a build worker and uploads it to stores, as `lk publish` does, with the environment's secrets as credentials

Usage: publish [OPTIONS] <STORES>...

Arguments:
  <STORES>...
          The stores to publish to

Options:
      --submit
          Also sends each upload for review or release, which reaches users

      --url <URL>
          Cloud origin; overrides `LEPTOSKIT_CLOUD_URL` and [cloud].url

      --detach
          Answers once the publish is queued instead of following it

      --json
          Prints the documented JSON result

      --org <ORG>
          Organization slug; defaults to [cloud].organization or your personal one

      --project <PROJECT>
          Project slug; defaults to [cloud].project

  -e, --environment <ENVIRONMENT>
          Environment name, for the commands about one; defaults to production

  -h, --help
          Print help
